hared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0AQJ-QTu7GtxaP4SoD07yA","review_id":"tZghh9AIE1LaCAT62c9FWg","date":"2015-04-04T23:45:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9334172606468201,"text_excerpt":"One of the things I was instructed to try once the weather started to get a little warmed was \"Sno-Balls\" in New Orleans. I've been on the hunt since I got here and I've finally been able to try it. The snow balls here are REALLY good! I'm a pretty traditional kind of guy so I just ordered cherry with sweetened condensed milk. It was awesome! Their snow is extremely fine and it holds the syrup perfectly like a slushy. What makes this place so great is the awesome service! The workers were are really really nice and spend the time to explain which flavors they really like best and have honest recommendations. I'll definitely be back especially when summer comes around."},{"business_id":"0AQJ-QTu7GtxaP4SoD07yA","review_id":"Bn-Ev3QiH5KtsyaAuLUOIQ","date":"2016-10-30T23:35:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9320845603942871,"text_excerpt":"This place is awesome! The people here are really friendly and nice. I am not a big fan of sweet flavored anything. So when I get here, I always get the Super Strawberry Lemonade with sliced strawberries-Light syrup. Sometimes, I will mix it with ice cream or almond cake for a kick of flavor. There are many creative and special combinations of flavors. The best part is stuffing the snowball with cheesecake if you are feeling extra fancy :) I would park along the sides since the parking lot is so tiny. Might as well burn off a few snowball calories :D I hope that Sno-LA will offer some natural or infused homemade syrups soon like Hansens and Imperial. That would be even more amazing!"},{"business_id":"0AQJ-QTu7GtxaP4SoD07yA","review_id":"-GiDffY4Y-sweZWJCUvzaQ","date":"2019-03-21T20:34:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9276072978973389,"text_excerpt":"My favorite snowball lounge in Nola is open year round! I can almost assure you that anything you try will be wonderful but in case you need a few recommendations I love the Sno-La Favorite and the Tiffany Blue Box. I like condensed milk as my topping but you really don't need it with the cheesecake stuffing! The service is always quick and polite. Would recommend for those nice spring and summer days!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0AQJ-QTu7GtxaP4SoD07yA","photo_id":"KrNZogLf8gQjfQsMDc-j9w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KrNZogLf8gQjfQsMDc-j9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8512434959411621},{"business_id":"0AQJ-QTu7GtxaP4SoD07yA","photo_id":"Z2-WtwGEcS0eqi_jyxxAcw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Z2-WtwGEcS0eqi_jyxxAcw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.839758038520813},{"business_id":"0AQJ-QTu7GtxaP4SoD07yA","photo_id":"9tzNSX_idzuRW0gD7tMb3Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/9tzNSX_idzuRW0gD7tMb3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8235525488853455},{"business_id":"0AQJ-QTu7GtxaP4SoD07yA","photo_id":"xlDN07OV0Pg845hVpf5QpA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/xlDN07OV0Pg845hVpf5QpA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7933005690574646},{"business_id":"0AQJ-QTu7GtxaP4SoD07yA","photo_id":"5SDZim5s16VJ-L1zUo6LQQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5SDZim5s16VJ-L1zUo6LQQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7306019067764282}]},"notebook_case":null}
